  "about": {
    "description": "Icehouse Tap Room is a local neighborhood beach bar and restaurant located on Little Lagoon in Gulf Shores, offering uninterrupted sunset views 365 days a year. Founded in 2000 in Baton Rouge, LA, it has expanded to Gulf Shores. The restaurant features a funky indoor space and beachy outdoor space with over 30 years of family-owned bar and restaurant experience. Not corporate driven, offering full menu with made-to-order items and 24 beers on tap.",
    "elevator_pitch": "A family-owned beach bar and restaurant with uninterrupted sunset views, 24 craft beers on tap, and late-night dining in Gulf Shores.",
    "vibe": "Casual, local, laid-back beach atmosphere with funky indoor and beachy outdoor spaces. A gathering place for friends, wanderers, and adventurers.",
